{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 4958062,
  "courseSlug": "remix-course",
  "courseTitle": "Remix.js - The Practical Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "34674760",
      "title": "Introducing Pathless Layout Routes",
      "lectureOrder": 50,
      "videoOrder": 45,
      "sourceHash": "7fdbc3acce6debbd28e1254a7a33ad523a60ba6a617db7efe298be7a57aef396",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.1,
          "end": 3.27,
          "en": "With all these pages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.27,
          "end": 5.34,
          "en": "being linked up correctly again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.34,
          "end": 8.67,
          "en": "it's now time to work on some styling issues",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.67,
          "end": 10.17,
          "en": "because as you can clearly tell,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.17,
          "end": 13.83,
          "en": "the pricing and home pages don't look the way they should.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.83,
          "end": 16.41,
          "en": "And in addition, also for expenses,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.41,
          "end": 18.45,
          "en": "if we go to the Analysis page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.45,
          "end": 20.94,
          "en": "to which we, by the way, will also soon add a link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 20.94,
          "end": 22.2,
          "en": "in the navigation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 22.2,
          "end": 25.83,
          "en": "this page also doesn't look that great.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 25.83,
          "end": 28.92,
          "en": "Now, the reason for that are clearly missing styles,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 28.92,
          "end": 31.35,
          "en": "missing CSS styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 31.35,
          "end": 33.87,
          "en": "Now, we could, of course, add them but the problem",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 33.87,
          "end": 36.48,
          "en": "with that is that for the analysis,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 36.48,
          "end": 38.37,
          "en": "the expenses analysis page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 38.37,
          "end": 41.85,
          "en": "styles are missing because the expenses' specific styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 41.85,
          "end": 44.85,
          "en": "are included and provided by the expenses page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 44.85,
          "end": 46.44,
          "en": "the expenses route here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 46.44,
          "end": 48.963,
          "en": "which is not a parent of the analysis route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 49.8,
          "end": 53.16,
          "en": "Path wise it is, but from a nesting perspective",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 53.16,
          "end": 55.23,
          "en": "and technically, it isn't.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 55.23,
          "end": 57.39,
          "en": "So this analysis route doesn't know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 57.39,
          "end": 60.33,
          "en": "about the styles exposed by expenses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 60.33,
          "end": 62.58,
          "en": "So therefore, those styles aren't loaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 62.58,
          "end": 64.503,
          "en": "when we visit the analysis route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 65.43,
          "end": 67.98,
          "en": "Of course, we could include them in our root route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 67.98,
          "end": 69.63,
          "en": "which wraps all pages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 69.63,
          "end": 72.06,
          "en": "but then these styles would also be loaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 72.06,
          "end": 74.34,
          "en": "for pages that absolutely don't need them,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 74.34,
          "end": 76.83,
          "en": "like the auth page, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 76.83,
          "end": 78.18,
          "en": "And we have a similar problem",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 78.18,
          "end": 81.06,
          "en": "with the starting page, the index.jsx file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 81.06,
          "end": 83.4,
          "en": "and the pricing page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 83.4,
          "end": 86.58,
          "en": "There, we've got some missing styles as you can clearly tell",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 86.58,
          "end": 88.08,
          "en": "and those styles, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 88.08,
          "end": 90.84,
          "en": "should only be loaded for these pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 90.84,
          "end": 95.28,
          "en": "But these pages have no layout, no parent component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 95.28,
          "end": 98.49000000000001,
          "en": "no parent page other than the root component here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 98.49000000000001,
          "end": 101.07,
          "en": "the root page, the root route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 101.07,
          "end": 104.97,
          "en": "But if we load these styles for index and pricing there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 104.97,
          "end": 107.34,
          "en": "they are automatically also available",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 107.34,
          "end": 110.58,
          "en": "and loaded for all the expenses pages, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 110.58,
          "end": 111.96000000000001,
          "en": "And we don't need those",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 111.96000000000001,
          "end": 114.543,
          "en": "marketing page-specific styles there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 115.53,
          "end": 116.85,
          "en": "So long story short,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 116.85,
          "end": 119.22,
          "en": "at the moment, with the current setup,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 119.22,
          "end": 122.22,
          "en": "we can't load the styles on the level",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 122.22,
          "end": 124.023,
          "en": "where we wanna load them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 124.86,
          "end": 126.48,
          "en": "But thankfully, this, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 126.48,
          "end": 129.51,
          "en": "is a common problem and Remix has a solution.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 129.51,
          "end": 132.81,
          "en": "It has pathless layout routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 132.81,
          "end": 136.203,
          "en": "But what are these pathless layout routes?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 137.52,
          "end": 139.98,
          "en": "Well, the idea is that with layout routes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 139.98,
          "end": 142.02,
          "en": "like the expenses layout route here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 142.02,
          "end": 145.11,
          "en": "you can wrap other routes and share components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 145.11,
          "end": 146.913,
          "en": "or also styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 147.87,
          "end": 150.3,
          "en": "Now, here we've got a couple of components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 150.3,
          "end": 153.39,
          "en": "these four components, these four routes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 153.39,
          "end": 155.28,
          "en": "that should share some styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 155.28,
          "end": 157.98,
          "en": "but we can't move the analysis route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 157.98,
          "end": 159.48,
          "en": "into the expenses folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 159.48,
          "end": 162.96,
          "en": "because it should not share the HTML markup",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 162.96,
          "end": 164.513,
          "en": "of the expenses.jsx file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 164.513,
          "end": 167.4,
          "en": "of this expenses layout route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 167.4,
          "end": 169.53,
          "en": "Now, a pathless layout route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 169.53,
          "end": 171.36,
          "en": "is a layout route we can add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 171.36,
          "end": 176.28,
          "en": "to add an extra layer, an extra level of nesting without,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 176.28,
          "end": 177.84,
          "en": "and that's the important part,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 177.84,
          "end": 181.203,
          "en": "without adding a new path to the URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 182.19,
          "end": 183.48,
          "en": "So here we could, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 183.48,
          "end": 185.88,
          "en": "add such a pathless layout route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 185.88,
          "end": 189.96,
          "en": "by adding a new folder called __app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 189.96,
          "end": 193.68,
          "en": "And the two leading underscores are important",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 193.68,
          "end": 196.07999999999998,
          "en": "because this signals to Remix",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 196.07999999999998,
          "end": 199.38,
          "en": "that this is a pathless layout route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 199.38,
          "end": 201.333,
          "en": "So __app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 202.2,
          "end": 205.14,
          "en": "and then we move the expenses.jsx file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 205.14,
          "end": 208.41,
          "en": "expenses.analysis and the expenses folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 208.41,
          "end": 211.203,
          "en": "into this __app folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 212.34,
          "end": 215.19299999999998,
          "en": "So now this is the routes folder structure we have.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 216.39,
          "end": 219.39,
          "en": "The expenses.raw.jsx file can stay outside",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 219.39,
          "end": 221.46,
          "en": "of the __app folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 221.46,
          "end": 223.92000000000002,
          "en": "because this will later be a special route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 223.92000000000002,
          "end": 226.44299999999998,
          "en": "that won't display any component anyways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 227.49,
          "end": 230.19,
          "en": "Now, just creating that folder is not enough though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 230.19,
          "end": 233.19299999999998,
          "en": "We also now have to create a file called __app.jsx.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 235.68,
          "end": 238.92000000000002,
          "en": "And here again, the two leading underscores",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 238.92000000000002,
          "end": 242.763,
          "en": "are important and it should be .jsx, not js.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 243.78,
          "end": 245.811,
          "en": "Now, the part after the underscores,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 245.811,
          "end": 248.55,
          "en": "app in my case here, is up to you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 248.55,
          "end": 250.5,
          "en": "for both the folder and the file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 250.5,
          "end": 252.48,
          "en": "but it should then be the same.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 252.48,
          "end": 255.81,
          "en": "So the folder name should match the file name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 255.81,
          "end": 257.4,
          "en": "So this now is pretty similar",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 257.4,
          "end": 260.28,
          "en": "to what we had before with expenses.jsx",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 260.28,
          "end": 262.17,
          "en": "and the expenses folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 262.17,
          "end": 265.83,
          "en": "It's just a strange-looking name but it's the same idea.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 265.83,
          "end": 268.32,
          "en": "The special thing is that this now allows us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 268.32,
          "end": 270.03,
          "en": "to add a layout component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 270.03,
          "end": 273.54,
          "en": "that does not introduce a new path in the URL",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 273.54,
          "end": 278.54,
          "en": "because I don't wanna have /app/expenses/add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 279.45,
          "end": 280.38,
          "en": "or anything like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 280.38,
          "end": 283.95,
          "en": "Instead it should still be /expenses/add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 283.95,
          "end": 286.95,
          "en": "but I wanna have an extra wrapper component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 286.95,
          "end": 287.94,
          "en": "and that's precisely",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 287.94,
          "end": 290.973,
          "en": "what this pathless layout component here will do for me.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 292.17,
          "end": 296.31,
          "en": "What we can do now is we can export a component here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 296.31,
          "end": 300.273,
          "en": "The ExpensesAppLayout, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 301.26,
          "end": 302.79,
          "en": "And in there, for the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 302.79,
          "end": 305.613,
          "en": "I'll just return my Outlet like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 306.48,
          "end": 310.89,
          "en": "And that's the important part, I'll export my links",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 310.89,
          "end": 313.56,
          "en": "because this is a regular route component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 313.56,
          "end": 315.33,
          "en": "It will be loaded by Remix.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 315.33,
          "end": 317.58,
          "en": "It will be loaded whenever we visit one",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 317.58,
          "end": 322.38,
          "en": "of the routes defined inside the __app folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 322.38,
          "end": 324.93,
          "en": "So therefore, since this is a regular route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 324.93,
          "end": 326.97,
          "en": "despite the strange-looking file name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 326.97,
          "end": 330,
          "en": "we can, of course, export our links here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 330,
          "end": 331.71,
          "en": "and make links available.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 331.71,
          "end": 334.803,
          "en": "And therefore, here I wanna make a stylesheet available.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 335.88,
          "end": 338.22,
          "en": "And the stylesheet that should be made available here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 338.22,
          "end": 340.62,
          "en": "are my expensesStyles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 340.62,
          "end": 345.62,
          "en": "I'll import them from ~/styles/expenses.css.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 347.61,
          "end": 351.573,
          "en": "And then make that available down there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 353.88,
          "end": 358.274,
          "en": "Now, we already have this code in the expenses.jsx file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 358.274,
          "end": 359.79,
          "en": "and there, we can now remove it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 359.79,
          "end": 361.44,
          "en": "because we don't need it twice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 361.44,
          "end": 362.55,
          "en": "Once is enough",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 362.55,
          "end": 365.34,
          "en": "but now the difference is that those styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 365.34,
          "end": 367.74,
          "en": "will be made available for all the routes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 367.74,
          "end": 369.69,
          "en": "in the __app folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 369.69,
          "end": 371.703,
          "en": "including this analysis route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 372.84,
          "end": 375.21,
          "en": "So therefore, with this change introduced,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 375.21,
          "end": 378.51,
          "en": "if we go to expenses/analysis,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 378.51,
          "end": 380.71,
          "en": "we're bringing back the styles for this page",
          "zh": ""
